title: The Boxheim Documents
new-page: true
subtitle: A set of documents detailing a violent seizure of power by the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Nazis</span> is discovered...
view-if: year = 1931 and month == 11 and investigate_far_right >= 3 and nsdap_votes > 20
