tags: event

= The Boxheim Documents

The recent state elections in Hesse has seen a massive surge in <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**NSDAP**</span> votes. [? if z_ideology == "Right": while the [? if z_party_name != "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">Center</span>?][? if z_party_name == "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">**CVP**</span>?] and <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**NSDAP**</span> attempt to negotiate a coalition agreement.?] This has allowed us to retain control of the Interior Ministry and granted our Wilhelm Leuschner, the authority to order house searches of <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Nazis</span> following a tip from a disgraced <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**NSDAP**</span> Landtag member.

During these searches, a copy of a letter sent by <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**NSDAP**</span> member Werner Best to the party leadership in Munich was discovered. The letter reveals their plan to violently seize power and includes guidelines for emergency decrees. Among these plans is a provision making access to food contingent on compulsory labor service, from which <span style="color: #005EB8;">Jews</span> would be exempt, implying they would receive no food at all.

What should we do with this information?

- @publicize
- @nothing
- @secret

@publicize
title: We will publicize the scandal to discredit the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**NSDAP**</span>.
on-arrival: nsdap_relation -= 15; left_strength += 5; 

In the democratic public and among the <span style="color: #700000;">Communists</span>, the disclosure of these documents have provoked a storm of indignation. From the <span style="color: #700000;">**KPD**</span> newspapers to the party press of the <span style="color: #69A2BE;">**BVP**</span>, there are demands for the author be brought before the Reich Court for high treason, since he has barely concealed the overthrow of the existing state order.
The <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD's**</span> <span style="color: #c00000;">Vorwärts</span> has commented

> *"For these people, governing means having others shot. Her imagination is filled with execution scenes, for her lust for power is synonymous with lust for murder."*

- @pressure_drop: We await the decision of the courts.
- @pressure: We await the decision of the courts.

@nothing
title: Do nothing with the information.
on-arrival: left_dissent += 5; nsdap_relation -= 5;

After further investigation, the Hessian <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD's**</span> interior minister Wilhelm Leuschner has passed the information along to the press.
In the democratic public and among the <span style="color: #700000;">Communists</span>, the disclosure of these documents have provoked a storm of indignation. From the <span style="color: #700000;">**KPD**</span> newspapers to the party press of the <span style="color: #69A2BE;">**BVP**</span>, there are demands for the author be brought before the Reich Court for high treason, since he has barely concealed the overthrow of the existing state order.
The <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD's**</span> <span style="color: #c00000;">Vorwärts</span> has commented

> *"For these people, governing means having others shot. Her imagination is filled with execution scenes, for her lust for power is synonymous with lust for murder."*

- @pressure_drop: We await the decision of the courts.
- @pressure: We await the decision of the courts.

@pressure_drop
view-if: judicial_reform >= 4
on-arrival: workers_nsdap -= 6; new_middle_nsdap -= 10; old_middle_nsdap -= 10; rural_nsdap -= 4; catholics_nsdap -= 3; workers_z += 2; catholics_z += 3; pro_republic += 8; sa_militancy -= 0.1; 

Due to our thorough reform of the judicial system, the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Nazis</span> behind these documents can now be publicly exposed and prosecuted by the state for high treason. This has dealt a severe blow to the constitutional appearance of the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**NSDAP**</span>, causing great distrust between them and the establishment parties, including President <span style="color: #808080;">Hindenburg</span> himself.

However, this has led to the collapse of our talks with the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**NSDAP**</span> about their possible entry into the Hessian state government. As such, the current <span style="color: #000000;">We</span><span style="color: #DD0000;">im</span><span style="color: #FFCC00;">ar</span> coalition shall remain in office as a caretaker government for the foreseeable future.    

@pressure
view-if: judicial_reform < 4
on-arrival: workers_nsdap -= 2; new_middle_nsdap -= 6; old_middle_nsdap -= 6; rural_nsdap -= 2; pro_republic += 5; sa_militancy -= 0.05; catholics_z += 2; 

Expectedly, the Ministry of Justice believes that the documents did not constitute a crime of high treason, as they argue that the document was directed against <span style="color: #700000;">communist</span> putschists, rather than the government.

This at least discredited the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Nazis</span> in the eyes of many who now question their committment to Hitler's legality tactics. With strong outrage from our left wing, this has led to the collapse of our talks with the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**NSDAP**</span> about their possible entry into the 

@secret
title: It is best to keep this information secret. Prevent the <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span> from spreading this to disrupt coalition talks with the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**NSDAP**</span>.
choose-if: left_strength <= 15 and spd_relation >= 60
unavailable-subtitle: There is too much pressure to release the documents 
on-arrival: left_dissent += 10; left_strength -= 5; 

Some among our leadership consider it unsavory to engage in cloak-and-dagger scheming. However, keeping this secret might be necessary to maintain good relations with the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**NSDAP**</span> and to ensure the continuation of the coalition talks. Our marginalized left wing strongly objects to our "Taming Strategy" of the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**NSDAP**</span> but their protests are futile. 

